      "description": "Saved topic choice shown in its selected state; not an archive subcategory tag.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-topic\" aria-pressed=\"true\">India</button>",
      "css": ".ds-topic{min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid var(--hairline,#DEE5F0);border-radius:9999px;color:var(--ink,#17243E);background:transparent;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:20px;font-family:var(--font-source,\"Source Sans 3\"),Arial,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s,border-color .15s;}.ds-topic:hover{border-color:var(--primary,#2F4BEB);}.ds-topic[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:var(--primary-hover,#243AC4);border-color:var(--primary-hover,#243AC4);color:#FFFFFF;}.ds-topic:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--primary,#2F4BEB);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-topic:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:not-allowed;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-topic{transition-duration:.01ms;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Article Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Responsive news card using the existing empty-image state as its self-contained media sample.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-news-card\"><a class=\"ds-card-photo\" href=\"#report\" aria-label=\"Open original report\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 22h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H8a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 1-4 0V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3\"/><path d=\"M18 14h-8M18 18h-8M10 6h8v4h-8z\"/></svg><span>Belgaum Today</span></a><div class=\"ds-card-copy\"><span class=\"ds-card-category\">India</span><h3><a href=\"#report\">Headline from the original report</a></h3><p class=\"ds-card-excerpt\">The publisher\u2019s excerpt appears here.</p><div class=\"ds-card-meta\"><span>Read at Publisher <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg> 0 views</span></div></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-news-card{max-width:400px;color:var(--ink,#17243E);font-family:var(--font-source,\"Source Sans 3\"),Arial,sans-serif;}.ds-card-photo{display:flex;aspect-ratio:16/9;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:15px;background:var(--soft,#E9EEFF);color:var(--muted,#5E6D85);font-size:13px;text-decoration:none;}.ds-card-category{color:var(--primary,#2F4BEB);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.035em;text-transform:uppercase;}.ds-news-card h3{font-family:var(--font-sora,\"Sora\"),sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:6px 0 9px;}.ds-news-card a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}.ds-news-card h3 a:hover{color:var(--primary,#2F4BEB);}.ds-news-card a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--primary,#2F4BEB);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-card-excerpt{font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted,#5E6D85);margin:0 0 12px;}.ds-card-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 14px;margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted,#5E6D85);font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;}.ds-card-meta span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;}@media(max-width:639px){.ds-news-card{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 90px;gap:16px;padding:19px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline,#DEE5F0);}.ds-card-photo{grid-column:2;grid-row:1;aspect-ratio:auto;height:84px;margin:0;}.ds-card-photo span{display:none;}.ds-card-copy{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;min-width:0;}.ds-news-card h3{font-size:18px;margin:5px 0 7px;}.ds-card-category{font-size:11px;}.ds-card-excerpt{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:8px;}.ds-card-meta{font-size:12px;margin-top:9px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Story Row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "story-row",
      "description": "Compact text-first story stream, with a trailing photo region and wrapped publisher/count metadata.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-story-row\"><div><span class=\"ds-row-category\">Technology</span><h3><a href=\"#report\">Headline from the original report</a></h3><p>The publisher\u2019s short excerpt appears here.</p><div class=\"ds-row-meta\"><span>Read at Publisher <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg> 0 views</span></div></div><a href=\"#report\" class=\"ds-row-photo\" aria-label=\"Open original report\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 22h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H8a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 1-4 0V9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3\"/><path d=\"M18 14h-8M18 18h-8M10 6h8v4h-8z\"/></svg></a></article>",
      "css": ".ds-story-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 100px;gap:16px;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--hairline,#DEE5F0);color:var(--ink,#17243E);font-family:var(--font-source,\"Source Sans 3\"),Arial,sans-serif;max-width:580px;}.ds-row-category{color:var(--primary,#2F4BEB);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.035em;text-transform:uppercase;}.ds-story-row h3{font-family:var(--font-sora,\"Sora\"),sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.35;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:5px 0 8px;}.ds-story-row a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}.ds-story-row h3 a:hover{color:var(--primary,#2F4BEB);}.ds-story-row a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--primary,#2F4BEB);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-story-row p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--muted,#5E6D85);margin:6px 0 8px;}.ds-row-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--muted,#5E6D85);}.ds-row-meta span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;}.ds-row-photo{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:88px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--soft,#E9EEFF);color:var(--muted,#5E6D85);}@media(max-width:639px){.ds-story-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 90px;}.ds-row-photo{height:84px;}.ds-row-category{font-size:11px;}.ds-row-meta{font-size:12px;gap:5px 12px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Home Cover Actions",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "home-action-white",
      "description": "Repeated white reading action and native category anchor on the fixed cobalt Home cover; the full cover also includes the attributed curved heritage photograph.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-home-cover-actions\"><p>The national picture. The local perspective. Your next good read.</p><a class=\"ds-home-white-action\" href=\"/briefing\">Read the briefing <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a><a class=\"ds-home-explore-action\" href=\"#explore\">Explore categories <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12l7 7 7-7\"/></svg></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-home-cover-actions{background:#2F4BEB;color:white;padding:24px;font-family:var(--font-source,\"Source Sans 3\"),Arial,sans-serif;}.ds-home-cover-actions>p{max-width:31ch;margin:0 0 26px;color:#E8EDFF;font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;}.ds-home-white-action{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:26px;min-height:50px;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:8px;background:white;color:#17243E;font-size:18px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.5;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color .18s,gap .25s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);}.ds-home-white-action:hover{background:#E9EEFF;gap:32px;}.ds-home-explore-action{display:flex;width:fit-content;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;margin-top:8px;color:white;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;}.ds-home-explore-action:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.ds-home-cover-actions a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid white;outline-offset:4px;}@media(max-width:639px){.ds-home-cover-actions>p{max-width:34ch;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:17px;line-height:1.4;}.ds-home-white-action{min-height:48px;padding:11px 17px;gap:20px;font-size:17px;}.ds-home-explore-action{margin-top:4px;font-size:15px;}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-home-white-action{transition:none;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Broadcast Briefing",
    "overview": "Broadcast Briefing uses a committed cobalt masthead, cool-white reading ground, navy text, bold geometric headings, and compact publisher-linked story streams. The character is direct and readable: photography carries the reporting while typography establishes a clear scan order.\n\nThe Home at `/` adds a persuasive, spacious expression of this identity: a full cobalt cover, oversized white display type, and an authentic Belagavi photograph. The reading feed lives at `/briefing`; its compact scan hierarchy remains the Read expression. The editorial workspace remains the denser Operate expression. The same palette, rounded controls, quiet borders, and sans-serif hierarchy connect these surfaces. Light and dark themes preserve these relationships. Real publisher content and images remain the material of news presentations; the built empty-image state uses a newspaper icon and the site name.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Cobalt identity with cool neutrals and a navy dark theme.",
      "Sora headings paired with Source Sans 3 reading text, with a distinct Home cover scale.",
      "A spacious Home opening into compact, responsive streams with visible publisher metadata.",
      "Quiet hairlines, rounded photos and controls, and visible focus."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Publisher Rule",
        "body": "Keep the publisher visible beside a story and preserve its source-linked action. Use real publisher imagery; never present mockup reporting as news.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Cover Scale Rule",
        "body": "Keep the oversized Home display on the Persuade cover; preserve the compact Read hierarchy and denser Operate scale elsewhere.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "Reading surfaces stay flat. Reserve cast shadows for transient menus, dialogs, and feedback.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the shared semantic color variables so light and dark themes stay coherent.",
      "Do preserve readable mobile type, visible keyboard focus, and 44px primary touch controls.",
      "Do keep source names, timestamps, and stored view counts legible, including zero counts.",
      "Do use the approved sans-serif pairing and real publisher photography.",
      "Do preserve the Home photo\u2019s visible source/license credit and bounded, reduced-motion-aware cover behavior."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't restore the old warm orange/cream palette, broadsheet masthead, or serif display typography.",
      "Don't restore the removed headline strip, category search forms, or subcategory tags, or make the lead story a scrollable carousel.",
      "Don't fabricate readership activity or replace publisher reporting with mock content.",
      "Don't remove focus outlines without an equally visible replacement."
    ]
  }
}
